Who knew there were so many sides to Jimmy Olson?

00:08:34.889 --> 00:08:36.889
Why do you have a problem with that?

00:08:36.889 --> 00:08:37.889
Not at all.

00:08:37.889 --> 00:08:41.809
I love a man of mystery.

00:08:41.809 --> 00:08:43.809
But I would keep the Abba away from Lois.

00:08:43.809 --> 00:08:47.210
She's a white snake girl, and I don't think she'd understand this side of

00:08:47.309 --> 00:08:49.309
Well, I don't think that Lois likes any side of me these days.

00:08:49.309 --> 00:08:52.309
She's still mad because I didn't tell her the truth about Lex Luthor's Arctic antics.

00:08:52.309 --> 00:08:55.309
Yeah, Lois wins medals for holding it grudge.

00:08:55.309 --> 00:09:00.309
Don't worry. Just a couple of weeks of walking around on eggshells and it'll all be over.

00:09:00.309 --> 00:09:02.309
Great.

00:09:02.309 --> 00:09:36.419
I guess we sort of skated over the conversation about boundaries.

00:09:36.419 --> 00:09:42.009
Looks like I stumbled into the razor wire surrounding the Clark issue again.

00:09:42.009 --> 00:09:47.950
I knew that he was your first love. I just...

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:50.950
Never knew that you felt like this.

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.950
It's ancient history.

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.950
I wrote that when I was 15.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.950
