00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:03.460
I'm the girl of your dreams.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:05.460
Masquerading is your best friend.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:10.399
You realize I'm living my biggest nightmare right now.

00:10:10.399 --> 00:10:12.399
Jimmy, it was a schoolgirl crush.

00:10:12.399 --> 00:10:16.399
And to be perfectly honest, this constant insecurity about Clark

00:10:16.399 --> 00:10:18.399
is really starting to wear thin.

00:10:18.399 --> 00:10:20.399
Every time I try and leave it in the past,

00:10:20.399 --> 00:10:22.399
it just keeps making its way into the present.

00:10:22.399 --> 00:10:26.840
I... I don't know what else I can do.

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:30.340
Why don't you start by asking yourself,

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:48.289
Why you never said these things to me?

00:10:48.289 --> 00:10:59.179
This arrived this morning.

00:10:59.179 --> 00:11:01.179
Meet me at the ace of clubs.

00:11:01.179 --> 00:11:05.529
Oliver sure hasn't lost his flair for the dramatic.

00:11:05.529 --> 00:11:07.529
You'll have a meeting out of your hand.

00:11:07.529 --> 00:11:13.279
Thank him for the dress, but send my regrets.

00:11:13.279 --> 00:11:37.879
Well, talk about being fashion forward,

00:11:37.879 --> 00:11:40.879
