00:11:40.879 --> 00:11:43.879
Whoever you are, I think it's time that you leave.

00:11:43.879 --> 00:11:47.799
Where's the owner of the Crystal?

00:11:47.799 --> 00:11:56.179
Crystal, I'm sorry, that doesn't ring a bell.

00:11:56.179 --> 00:12:01.179
Well, but maybe if you told me about the owner, I could help you.

00:12:01.179 --> 00:12:07.610
He's Kryptonian and my perfect mate.

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:11.610
You know, I thought there'd be more of them on this planet,

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.610
but every single man I've come across has been a human.

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:15.610
Hmm.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:23.710
Maybe if we work together, I could help you find this...

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:29.360
Cryptonian.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.360
