00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:39.360
You're trying to keep him for yourself, aren't you?

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.360
Well, I've traveled too far to let you stand in my way.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:13:01.919
Lois, I thought you said you didn't have time to work on this article.

00:13:01.919 --> 00:13:03.919
That's when it was going to end up buried on the last page,

00:13:03.919 --> 00:13:07.919
but with the superendorphine angle, the scoop is a lot bigger.

00:13:07.919 --> 00:13:09.919
Now, you just learned to dog paddle your way through a story.

00:13:09.919 --> 00:13:15.460
What kind of friend would I be if I threw you in the deep end without a floaty?

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.460
What did the police officers say?

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:19.460
They found evidence of a fire in the alley, but they suspect it's unrelated.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:20.460
it's unrelated.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.460
So in other words, there's no reason for us to come down here.

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.460
Common rookie mistake.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:26.460
See, that's why you're lucky I came along.

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:29.460
The scorch marks are probably from a homeless ho-down.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:48.750
If we talk to a few local transients, maybe somebody saw something.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.750
Well, this story just made it above the fold.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:55.750
Cops say a string of hormone jacked stiffs turned up between Metropolis and Smallville.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:14:01.750
All males. Ask me, I think we have a meteor freak on a rampage.

