They make you look so easy.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.500
Easy.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:47.500
Women are a complicated species, dude.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.500
You have to embrace a little survival of the fittest.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:54.500
Make her realize she's not the only fox in the forest.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:58.820
You are so right.

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:08.820
I see you're the only one in here that's all alone.

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:11.820
I think you're the man that I've been looking for.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:31.980
Hey, am I glad to see you.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.980
Now that Lois is riding shotgun in your mystery machine,

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.980
your old sidekicks Jones in for a Scooby clue.

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:37.980
Let me see you.

