00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:47.980
This belongs to their queen.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.980
A planet called Almorac.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:52.980
Chloe, I didn't realize that your brainiac downloaded

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:55.980
included some sort of intergalactic encyclopedia.

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:57.980
Were there fresh burn marks in the area?

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:58.980
Yeah.

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:01.980
