00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.620
Endorphins and adrenaline.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:20.250
All the men died the same way.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.250
She's searching for her mate.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.250
Those chemicals must be released into her victims

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.250
