00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:53.740
Chloe, do you remember when you said we talk about your condition?

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:55.740
You know if things got worse?

00:16:55.740 --> 00:17:02.049
Clark, I've analyzed every possible scenario, and as much as it scares me,

00:17:02.049 --> 00:17:05.049
