00:17:05.049 --> 00:17:06.049
I'll find a way.

00:17:06.049 --> 00:17:08.049
Clark, that's just how it is.

00:17:08.049 --> 00:17:11.049
There's nothing you can do, so just let it go.

00:17:11.049 --> 00:17:17.299
Here we go.

00:17:17.299 --> 00:17:20.299
According to the police wire, it looks like she struck again.

00:17:20.299 --> 00:17:23.299
They just found a German businessman outside the ace of clubs.

00:17:23.299 --> 00:17:24.299
clubs.

