00:18:56.200 --> 00:19:02.940
Oh, me.

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.940
I'm really sorry.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:08.940
You were so sweet, I really hoped you were the one.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:20:09.460
Now that's more like it.

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:11.460
Good evening, Miss Sullivan.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.460
I am sorry for the cloak and dagger routine,

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:17.460
