00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:24.460
I know who you are and I don't care to talk with anyone connected to Lex Luthor.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:27.460
And it's no secret that you and Lex have your differences,

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:28.460
