00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:33.460
I'm sure that you are far too fair a person to fault me for his mistakes.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:37.220
Because I really need your help.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:43.220
I know that you've cracked into some of the most complex and protected computer systems in the world.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.220
And I'd like to hire you to do the same for me.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:52.220
I guess Lex's lackeys didn't tell you that he actually dropped the dime on me for being a techno-wins.

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:55.220
I was locked up. It wasn't pretty.

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.220
Well, no laws will be broken.

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:59.220
You'll be trying to hack.

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:06.109
to hack a very unique supercomputer.

00:21:06.109 --> 00:21:09.109
Sorry. My plate's full.

00:21:09.109 --> 00:21:12.109
Yeah, I'm sure planning a wedding and starting at the Isis Foundation

00:21:12.109 --> 00:21:14.109
