00:21:25.579 --> 00:21:28.579
Which is why I know you're the only person that can help me.

00:21:28.579 --> 00:21:31.579
So I'm hoping you'll reconsider.

00:21:31.579 --> 00:21:33.950
You learned well from Lex's.

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:36.950
I learned well from Lex.

